<title>GERMANY: POLL - German Ifo July business climate index.</title>
<headline>POLL - German Ifo July business climate index.</headline>
<dateline>FRANKFURT 1997-08-15</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Ifo-Institute in Munich will publish its business climate index for west Germany on Wednesday. Ten analysts were polled on Friday and gave the following forecasts. The index showed a reading of 96.0 in June.</p>
<p>ECONOMIST						Index July 97</p>
<p>Harald Joerg, Dresdner Bank, Frankfurt	    96.5</p>
<p>Jens Kramer, Norddt. Landesbank, Hanover	  96.5</p>
<p>Ralf Kugelstadt, UBS, Frankfurt		     97.2</p>
<p>Klaus Papenbrock, DB Research, Frankfurt	  96.5</p>
<p>Eckhard Schulte, IBJ, Frankfurt		     96.4</p>
<p>Joerg Kraemer, Merrill Lynch, Frankfurt	   96.7</p>
<p>Timo Klein, MMS International, Frankfurt	  96.8</p>
<p>Lothar Hessler, TCM, Duesseldorf		    96.5</p>
<p>Ralf Sueppel, JP Morgan, Frankfurt		  96.5</p>
<p>Gerhard Grebe, Bank Julius Baer, Frankfurt	96.8</p>
<p>-- Frankfurt Newsroom +49 69 756525</p>
